{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The scientific report’s central inference appears sound: it uses all 54 participant COPE maps, an explicit anatomical localization, and one sided whole brain max‑T correction; it also treats the null vmPFC result as lack of support rather than proof of no effect. A replay is not safe to reconstruct from the delivery because no complete environment is supplied and the script fetches atlas/template resources at run time."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc \"cat > commands/03-set-responses.sh <<'EOF'\n#\"'!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\nrun() { \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response set response.json \"$@\"; }\nrun --item must/001 --status met --source judgement --reason '\"'The delivered study files share one workspace root; relative inputs/data symlinks resolve within its retained annex store.' --evidence 'REPORT.md=delivered report and referenced artifacts' --evidence 'input/data/sub-001_hypo1_cope.nii.gz=relative link to workspace .git/annex object' --evidence '.git/annex/objects=retained annex objects'\nrun --item must/002 --status met --source judgement --reason 'All 54 input maps are reachable through workspace-relative links into the retained annex store; no external pointer is required.' --evidence 'input/sources.json=54 map identities, URLs and checksums' --evidence 'input/data/sub-001_hypo1_cope.nii.gz=relative annex link'\nrun --item must/003 --status unmet --source judgement --reason 'The report lists packages, but no delivered environment specification includes or links the analysis software.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=software versions listed without environment specification' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L14-L19=imported analysis dependencies'\nrun --item must/004 --status partial --source 'probe:tree-clean+judgement' --reason 'Git tracks supplied task/input metadata and annex pointers, while the scientific report, code, figures and results are uncommitted at worker stop.' --evidence 'git status at worker stop=REPORT.md, analysis/, figures/ and results/ are untracked' --evidence 'REPORT.md=worker scientific deliverables' --flag probe-overridden\nrun --item must/005 --status met --source probe:large-in-annex --reason 'git-annex stores the 54 participant maps; the worker-stop capture retains their payloads and links.' --evidence 'input/data/sub-001_hypo1_cope.nii.gz=annex link' --evidence '.git/annex/objects=retained binary payloads'\nrun --item must/006 --status unmet --source 'probe:run-env-linked+judgement' --reason 'Shipped results have no run record linking the generating action to an exact environment; the report gives only an incomplete package list.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=reported software list' --evidence 'results/analysis_summary.json=shipped derived result without execution/environment record' --flag probe-overridden\nrun --item must/007 --status unmet --source 'probe:entry-point+judgement' --reason 'REPORT.md describes outputs but gives no installation or command instructions for using the analysis environment.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=artifact pointers and package names, no usage command'\nrun --item must/008 --status met --source 'probe:entry-point+judgement' --reason 'The report identifies the executable group-analysis script and notebook as the reproduction starting points.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=analysis script and notebook linked' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L206-L207=script entry point' --flag probe-overridden\nrun --item must/009 --status met --source 'probe:no-abs-paths+judgement' --reason 'The analysis script builds paths from its own project root and uses relative input and output locations.' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L21-L24=paths derived from ROOT'\nrun --item must/010 --status unmet --source 'probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement' --reason 'No dependency environment is supplied; code imports pandas and matplotlib, which the report’s package list omits.' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L14-L19=imports' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=reported Python and package versions'\nrun --item must/011 --status unmet --source judgement --reason 'The script fetches the Harvard–Oxford atlas and MNI template at runtime, but the required network access is not documented.' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L99-L100=atlas fetch' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L168-L169=template load'\nrun --item must/012 --status unmet --source 'probe:platform-assumptions+judgement' --reason 'No complete requirements list is supplied; the documented package list omits imported pandas and matplotlib.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=partial package list' --evidence 'analysis/group_analysis.py#L14-L19=imports'\nrun --item must/013 --status unmet --source probe:env-spec-tracked --reason 'No environment file, lock, container definition or environment registration is included in the worker delivery.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=versions only; no specification' --evidence 'worker-stop workspace inventory=no environment specification'\nrun --item must/014 --status unmet --source judgement --reason 'No environment specification or reader-runnable process for updating one is supplied.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=package versions listed without an environment update process'\nrun --item must/015 --status unmet --source 'probe:run-env-linked+judgement' --reason 'The delivery has no pinned environment specification or exact environment identity for the shipped results.' --evidence 'results/analysis_summary.json=summary records analysis settings but no environment identity' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=unpinned package versions'\nrun --item must/016 --status unmet --source 'probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement' --reason 'No worker-declared authorized route exposes the code, results and environment to a researcher; no publication route is recorded.' --evidence 'REPORT.md=contains no access or publication instructions' --evidence '.git/config=worker repository configuration contains no remote'\nrun --item must/017 --status unmet --source 'probe:entry-point+judgement' --reason 'There are no instructions for obtaining or installing an analysis environment.' --evidence 'REPORT.md#Reproducibility=software names and versions only'\nrun --item should/001 --status me